  2 observation\
          2-1  The use of migration dataset is to show migration flow between countries where the dataset included all 224 countries in the world,  where in the table the first two columns shows the origin (source) and destination (target) countries and the remaining column represent width which is for difference years 1990 to 2024.\
          Where the dataset include male and female, the value shown is the summation of both gender moving from one country to another.\
\
  3 Period \
       3-1 The migration dataset shows the time series of five years gap of 1990, 1995, 2000, 2005, 2010, 2015, 2020, 2024.\
       3-2 Population dataset shows the time series from 1990 to 2024\
 \
